{"reviewId": "2120287_87xF6W7SX", "review": {"abstract": "这里我们想说的是，中国工业化的原动力依然存在，依靠固定资产投资拉动的经济增长模式不会立即改变，中国在经济增长中利用财政政策的手段依然有效。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterUid": 10, "content": "我认为疫情过后的这几年，中国的固定资产已经跌到了最低点，那么靠投资拉动之后，接下来的经济靠什么来拉动呢?", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "18489-18558", "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterName": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "chapterIdx": 10, "reviewId": "2120287_87xF6W7SX", "userVid": 2120287, "topics": [], "createTime": 1773284219, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "05 走向成熟 中国经济即将V形反转", "author": {"userVid": 2120287, "name": "J·Sir", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/VDibIp2afF7xlWGsxwUU07sfEgWu4EYKwS7CIQAryyjIFCw0I4M9eI0ZtKWutcgXjibpTKkRRyJYLUK4nJ1NrN4l7SbvSPsTUCQia6pibqiaF52Y/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "这个人是如此聪明，他可以向任何人学习", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-2-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 2, "likes": [{"userVid": 255317060, "name": "liuyouyou", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0018-gMQzcaXp69zUIS5LPhP6Hd9/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "liuyouyou", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-365", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 365}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"conten